bulk-shading:0: set probeValues to "unresolved-sentinel"
bulk-shading:1: set probeValues to get background pattern color of shading of every character of text object of boundDoc
bulk-shading:2: set probeVectorClass to (class of probeValues) as text
bulk-shading:3: if class of probeValues is not list then error "BULK_VALUES_NOT_LIST"
bulk-shading:4: set probeScalarValues to {}
bulk-shading:5: repeat with probeValueOrdinal from 1 to count probeValues
bulk-shading:6: set probeValue to item probeValueOrdinal of probeValues
bulk-shading:7: if class of probeValue is not list then error "BULK_RGB_NOT_LIST"
bulk-shading:7: if class of probeValue is not list then error "BULK_RGB_NOT_LIST", -2700

